{"id":"tarantula","name":"Tarantula","type":"Linear Fusion Rifle","tier":"Legendary","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/26e14672cecd7c19e33902dcd1c05db6.jpg","screenshot":"/common/destiny2_content/screenshots/3335343363.jpg","columns":[{"label":"Barrel","weight":1,"perks":[{"name":"Arrowhead Brake","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8f7fb54687aa52a9c2595d90ce9c9417.png","desc":"Lightly vented barrel.\n  •  Greatly controls recoil\n  •  Increases handling speed"},{"name":"Chambered Compensator","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0b451cbccc7f11f6aec9c153e59474cb.png","desc":"Stable barrel attachment.\n  •  Increases stability\n  •  Moderately controls recoil\n  •  Slightly decreases handling speed"},{"name":"Corkscrew Rifling","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7730e1732ed7ef91afce50277639c493.png","desc":"Balanced barrel. \n  •  Slightly increases range and stability\n  •  Slightly increases handling speed"},{"name":"Extended Barrel","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/d9e5e8fa07a84c29252b78b0e7b3106d.png","desc":"Weighty barrel extension.\n  •  Increases range\n  •  Decreases handling speed\n  •  Moderately controls recoil"},{"name":"Fluted Barrel","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/260eba9dd149dbb94b1306c9ed4dd8db.png","desc":"Ultra-light barrel. \n  •  Greatly increases handling speed\n  •  Slightly increases stability"},{"name":"Full Bore","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/40a4bdcf0f5a4e492927f9569eaf529d.png","desc":"Barrel optimized for distance.\n  •  Greatly increases range\n  •  Decreases stability\n  •  Slightly decreases handling speed"},{"name":"Hammer-Forged Rifling","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/2b9eb6d4489cffc18c10223279198bcc.png","desc":"Durable ranged barrel.\n  •  Increases range"},{"name":"Polygonal Rifling","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7d7aaccee29cf450d4057a9de871cdc8.png","desc":"Barrel optimized for recoil reduction.\n  •  Increases stability"},{"name":"Smallbore","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7d1bb6a623f14959a47156ee71acfc3a.png","desc":"Dual strength barrel.\n  •  Increases range\n  •  Increases stability"},{"name":"Full Choke","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/629246e67fc8690d56b5478b0262131a.png","desc":"Tightened barrel. Reduces projectile spread when aiming down sights at the cost of precision damage."},{"name":"Rifled Barrel","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/79d5f1f469d3290cfb849f4b3e6fc16b.png","desc":"Ranged shotgun barrel.\n  •  Increases range\n  •  Greatly decreases handling speed"}]},{"label":"Battery","weight":1,"perks":[{"name":"Accelerated Coils","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/a51d91da9fb0a4c8f45b2ffa89e51ad7.png","desc":"Speeds up charge.\n  •  Faster charge time\n  •  Decreases impact damage"},{"name":"Enhanced Battery","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0ee59b61e99c52c85c2ea18ab705f700.png","desc":"Strong battery life.\n  •  Increases magazine size"},{"name":"Ionized Battery","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/a278b79aba1d341d2a070c0e48d9129a.png","desc":"Large heavy battery.\n  •  Greatly increases magazine size\n  •  Greatly decreases reload speed"},{"name":"Liquid Coils","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/01e813d983526b009b4e1c700a1d0081.png","desc":"Slower-building charge for higher damage.\n  •  Increases impact damage\n  •  Slower charge time"},{"name":"Particle Repeater","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8a273117023794757631a34803314351.png","desc":"Improves stability. \n  •  Increases stability"},{"name":"Projection Fuse","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/eaa6fcec699a88e768782068d5e509e1.png","desc":"Distance optimizations.\n  •  Increases range"}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Feeding Frenzy","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/89d7e65f5ebe8d291ea96f128765921d.png","desc":"Each rapid kill with this weapon progressively increases reload speed for a short time."},{"name":"Firmly Planted","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/379796d2e74676d3790f0bd485ea03a9.png","desc":"Increased accuracy, stability, and handling when firing while crouched."},{"name":"Moving Target","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/40b591eae7f122fdf1cfca21fc6f6c0f.png","desc":"Increased movement speed and target acquisition when moving while aiming down sights."},{"name":"Genesis","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/087a911353a3586f5346a1cf88d8de05.png","desc":"Breaking a combatant's shield with this weapon fills its magazine from reserves. Energy weapons regenerate ammo on hit when matching the damage type to the combatant's shield."},{"name":"Field Prep","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/4ee1ecaead6fe2de1a2cab07f8b7be3f.png","desc":"Increases ammo generation. Faster reload, stow, and ready speed when you're crouching."},{"name":"Pulse Monitor","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/64642b7455e88ffde77be53ce7cb7c05.png","desc":"Automatically reloads the magazine and improves weapon handling when wounded—even when this weapon is stowed."}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Wellspring","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/ec2e3096ebd447bd6137735c9067b991.png","desc":"Kills with this weapon generate ability energy. This energy is divided between your uncharged abilities."},{"name":"Snapshot Sights","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/ce16c9e2cbd73bb548af3e15bdfc7177.png","desc":"Faster time to aim down sights."},{"name":"Kill Clip","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0afd4799427004b2d8170ab213a2ef0c.png","desc":"Reloading after a kill grants increased damage."},{"name":"Dragonfly","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/c87b03bb6d56b393f8582e128b337332.png","desc":"Precision kills create an elemental damage explosion."},{"name":"Rampage","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8976ead57430e4f5f8af1b3005de4f83.png","desc":"Kills with this weapon temporarily grant increased damage. Stacks 3x."},{"name":"Box Breathing","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/ef9c0dbddcb4c51fe5d3768e26b73746.png","desc":"Aiming this weapon for a short period without firing grants bonus range and precision damage that resets after firing or exiting zoom."}]}],"notes":["[YeezyGT's S16] [MW: Charge Time/Range] \"Tarantula is the weaker of the Linear Fusion Rifle family, though it can still do a couple interesting things for picking off individual targets. Field Prep/Firmly Planted help with consistency, Pulse Monitor in a \"dueling\" scenario, Moving Target for the Aim Assist bump, and Box Breathing for a one-time damage boost per-shot.\" tags:pve","File auto generated from csv pandapaxxy-s15-roundup (tags: controller,god-pve)","File auto generated from csv pandapaxxy-s15-roundup (tags: controller,god-pvp)","File auto generated from csv pandapaxxy-s15-roundup (tags: god-pvp)","File auto generated from csv pandapaxxy-s15-roundup (tags: controller,pve)","File auto generated from csv pandapaxxy-s15-roundup (tags: controller,pvp)","File auto generated from csv pandapaxxy-s15-roundup (tags: pvp)"],"estimated":null,"modes":{"all":{"rolls":[[4,11,18,24],[4,11,18,27],[4,11,19,24],[4,11,19,27],[4,11,21,28],[4,11,22,28],[4,12,21,26],[4,12,21,28],[4,12,22,28],[4,16,18,24],[4,16,18,27],[4,16,19,24],[4,16,19,27],[5,11,18,24],[5,11,18,27],[5,11,19,24],[5,11,19,27],[5,16,18,24],[5,16,18,27],[5,16,19,24],[5,16,19,27],[6,11,18,24],[6,11,18,27],[6,11,19,24],[6,11,19,27],[6,11,21,28],[6,11,22,28],[6,12,21,28],[6,12,22,28],[6,16,18,24],[6,16,18,27],[6,16,19,24],[6,16,19,27],[8,11,21,28],[8,11,22,28],[8,12,21,28],[8,12,22,28],[0,11,18,25],[0,11,18,28],[0,11,19,25],[0,11,19,28],[0,11,21,25],[0,11,21,28],[0,11,22,25],[0,11,22,28],[0,12,18,25],[0,12,18,28],[0,12,19,25],[0,12,19,28],[0,12,21,25],[0,12,21,28],[0,12,22,25],[0,12,22,28],[0,14,18,25],[0,14,18,28],[0,14,19,25],[0,14,19,28],[0,14,21,25],[0,14,21,28],[0,14,22,25],[0,14,22,28],[2,11,18,25],[2,11,18,28],[2,11,19,25],[2,11,19,28],[2,11,21,25],[2,11,21,28],[2,11,22,25],[2,11,22,28],[2,12,18,25],[2,12,18,28],[2,12,19,25],[2,12,19,28],[2,12,21,25],[2,12,21,28],[2,12,22,25],[2,12,22,2